The first time I got to Gehemmon, I was a Samurai with a +7
Grayswandir and a +6 Katana.  With the speed of a Samurai, you
get two blows before they can do anything.  And most of the
time, with those weapons, that's enough---after two blows, it's
too late for them to teleport.  (At least, that's how I remember
it.  I know that I didn't even realize they would teleport until
later games.)

Even with lesser weapons, they don't bother me.  Once they're
angry, they come after me, letting me get to the down stairs.
Then, once they're next to me, I go down, they follow, and I'm
on the up stairs, so they can't teleport there.

